  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project assists one of marginalized population namely the female pre-trial detainees, inmates, and ex-prisoner. In a patriarchal society, such as Timor-Leste, women face multiple discriminatory practice daily. More so is the case for women in prisons, such as the application of discriminatory laws, unjust treatment, or negligence of their special needs. The project intends to tackle the institutionalized human right violations currently accruing in correctional facilities to restore a sense</narrative>
  </description>
